## Styler

What to test:

- The Software series renders cyan with a blue dashed stroke; the Hardware series renders hotpink with a magenta stroke.
- Series-level `fill`, `stroke` and `strokeWidth` set to ignored values do not appear; only the styler output applies.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler" name="styler" type="generated" options={ "exampleHeight": 1000 } /%}

## Styler & Item Styler

What to test:

- Base styler colours apply across all bars in each series.
- The `Q1'22` Software bar uses the light-blue item-styler override; the `Q3'23` Hardware bar uses the dark-khaki override.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler & Item Styler" name="styler-and-itemstyler" type="generated" options={ "exampleHeight": 1000 } /%}

## Styler Highlight State

What to test:

- Hover a bar; that bar fills yellow (Software) or lime (Hardware) while its siblings fade.
- Hover a legend item; the matching series highlights gold/limegreen and the other dims to the unhighlighted-series styling.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler Highlight State" name="styler-highlight-state" type="generated" options={ "exampleHeight": 1000 } /%}
